    <!-- STEP 5 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-head"><span class="step-no">STEP 5</span>循环游玩 —— 让游戏"活"起来</div>
      <p>现在游戏只能玩一局就退出，不满足需求 ④。用第 4 课的 <span class="hl-c">while</span> 把「整局游戏」包起来。需要动三处：</p>
      <p>① 在 def 之后、hp = 100 之前，加一个<span class="hl">游戏开关变量</span>和循环头；</p>
      <p>② 把从 <span class="hl-c">hp = 100</span> 到结算的<b>全部代码整体缩进 4 格</b>（表示它们属于循环体，每局都会重新执行——尤其 hp = 100、gold = 0 每局重置，这是关键！）；</p>
      <p>③ 循环体末尾加「再来一局」询问，玩家答 n 就关掉开关；循环外面（顶格）写告别语。</p>
      <div class="code"><span class="v">playing</span> = <span class="k">True</span>                <span class="c"># ① 游戏开关：True = 继续玩</span>
<span class="k">while</span> <span class="v">playing</span>:                <span class="c"># ② 条件为 True 就一直循环</span>
    <span class="v">hp</span> = <span class="n">100</span>                  <span class="c">#    每局开始，血槽回满</span>
    <span class="v">gold</span> = <span class="n">0</span>                  <span class="c">#    每局开始，金币清零</span>
    <span class="v">show_status</span>(<span class="v">name</span>, <span class="v">hp</span>, <span class="v">gold</span>)
    <span class="c"># ……从三条通道到结算的全部代码，都缩进 4 格放这里……</span>

    <span class="v">again</span> = <span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">"再来一局？(y/n)："</span>)   <span class="c"># ③ 局末询问</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="v">again</span> != <span class="s">"y"</span>:
        <span class="v">playing</span> = <span class="k">False</span>              <span class="c">#    关灯！循环条件变 False，游戏结束</span>

<span class="k">print</span>()                        <span class="c"># 循环结束后（顶格）才会执行</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"感谢游玩《新手村传说》！再见，"</span>, <span class="v">name</span>, <span class="s">"！"</span>)</div>
      <p>为什么用 <span class="hl-c">playing</span> 变量而不是死循环 + break？两种都合法，但用"开关变量"让循环条件一目了然，代码更好读——这是团队协作的写法习惯。</p>
    </div>

